Bundled third-party data
------------------------

llmplan/data/traces/samples/ contains adapted excerpts of public LLM inference traces,
redistributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC-BY-4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). These files are not covered by
the Apache License; their CC-BY-4.0 terms apply.

- Azure LLM inference traces 2023 (code, conversation) and 2024 (code, conversation;
  one week), Microsoft Azure Public Dataset, https://github.com/Azure/AzurePublicDataset,
  CC-BY-4.0. Cite Patel et al., "Splitwise", ISCA 2024 (2023 traces) and Stojkovic et al.,
  "DynamoLLM", HPCA 2025 (2024 traces).
- BurstGPT release v2.0 (BurstGPT_1.csv), https://github.com/HPMLL/BurstGPT, CC-BY-4.0.
  Cite Wang et al., "BurstGPT", 2024.

Changes made: the busiest and the median-load hour of each trace were selected and
thinned uniformly to at most 20,000 rows, timestamps converted to relative seconds,
columns renamed to llmplan's generic CSV format, and rows with invalid token counts
dropped. Per-file details: llmplan/data/traces/samples/README.md.

The GPU specifications, prices and benchmark figures under llmplan/data/ are facts read
from the public pages named in each row's source_url, with the date read in as_of.
